title: Welcome
position: 0,0
---
Casey: Hey, morning!
Grump: Oh, it's you. Shouldn't you be getting to class?
Casey: ...
Parrot: Hey! Newbie! Wanna hear my strategy for grading tests?
-> Casey: Sure.
    <<detour Yap>>
-> Casey: No thanks.
    Parrot: Suit yourself.
<<jump Gossip>>
===

title: Gossip
color: blue
position: 200,200
---
Parrot: Did you hear? She's absent again. 
Grump: I'd be shocked if she graduates.
Parrot: Seriously. Such a delinquent. Someone like her shouldn't walk with the rest of the students.
Grump: Agreed. Aren't you worried, Miss Casey?
-> Casey: She's improving.
    Grump: If I were you, I'd be more worried. I mean, I take my reputation seriously.
    Parrot: Clearly, not everyone does...
-> Casey: Yes, I am.
    Parrot: You should be.
<<jump End>> 
===

title: Yap
color: blue
position: -200,200
---
Parrot: yapyapyapyap
Parrot: And basically, if student A gets a grade above {$gradeA}, I just curve everyone else's grades up by 5 points.
<<set $gradeA = $gradeA - 5>>
Parrot: And if student A gets {$gradeA} or below, I just fail them all.
Parrot: Works like a charm every time.
Casey: ...
Grump: ...
===

title: End
